{"content":[{"c":["HORESH"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Hebrew word translated as a place-name in ",{"href":"?bref=1Sam.23.15-19","r":"1Sam.23.15-19","rawR":"1Sam.23.15-19","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Sam.23.15-19","value":"1Sam.23.15-19"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Samuel 23:15-19"}," (part of the wilderness of Ziph). David hid from Saul there, and met secretly with Jonathan. The word is translated simply as “wooded areas” in ",{"href":"?bref=2Chr.27.4","r":"2Chr.27.4","rawR":"2Chr.27.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Chr.27.4","value":"2Chr.27.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Chronicles 27:4"}," (",{"c":["nlt"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"},"). Authorities differ on whether the place-name in 1 Samuel is warranted."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Horesh","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"1 Samuel 23:15-19","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=1Sam.23.15-19","rawQueryValue":"1Sam.23.15-19","sourceRefExact":"1Sam.23.15-19"},{"anchorText":"2 Chronicles 27:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Chr.27.4","rawQueryValue":"2Chr.27.4","sourceRefExact":"2Chr.27.4"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"017f547cd3d032a33d9a16a3aed308acfd76c980d3490ffb359e2917bdfc4a5e","sourceItemName":"Horesh","sourceItemOrder":348,"sourceMember":"Articles/H.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Horesh","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Horesh","title":"Horesh","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}